Revision history for Linux-Event-Async

0.001_001  2026-08-30
    - Initial development skeleton for the separate Linux::Event::Async
      distribution.
    - Add Linux::Event::Async import wrapper for Future::AsyncAwait.
    - Add Linux::Event::Async::Stream reusable receive Awaitable using the
      Linux::Event native Stream consumer ABI.
    - Add Linux::Event::Async::Future for async-sub result Futures.
    - Vendor the Linux::Event consumer ABI v1 header.
